WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.425
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.350
ANISH MALHOTRA: Google
Cloud just moved

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.530
into your neighborhood.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:09.820
Hi and namaste.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.280
I'm Anish.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.220
I lead the customer engineering
team in India and Asia,

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.920
helping customers
migrate to Google Cloud.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.730
We're seeing huge demand
for Google Cloud in India,

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.890
with customers like Hike,
Dainik Bhaskar, Ashok Leyland,

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.089
Inshorts, and Walnut,
to name a few.

00:00:25.089 --> 00:00:26.880
This is the reason why
we and our customers

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.550
are so excited to see the
launch of a news region

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.720
in Mumbai, India.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.780
For the first time
ever, GCP users

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.340
can process and
store data in India.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.520
Our services include
Compute, Big Data, Storage,

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.240
and Networking.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.970
This new India region
has everything that you

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.070
need to build and scale.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:47.240
It has been an amazing journey
to onboard Hike as a customer.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.130
We're running their entire
infrastructure and analytics

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.220
platform in Google Cloud to run
their cross-platform instant

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.370
messaging service.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.880
I love working with Inshorts,
who are using Google Compute

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.740
Engine to power
their news content

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.390
delivery mobile application.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:02.475
The new region in
Mumbai means speed.

00:01:02.475 --> 00:01:04.500
Our performance testing
of the Mumbai region

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.290
shows 50% to 90%
reduction in latency

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.210
when serving
customers in India, as

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.370
compared to other
GCP regions in Asia,

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.870
like Singapore and Taiwan.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.450
GCP is the smart
secure cloud that will

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.010
move your business forward.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.020
With the opening of
the new Mumbai region,

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.230
Google is your new neighbor,
right here, right next door.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.380
[MUSIC PLAYING]

